From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:56:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1200/3799] soh: rename func_80A7A940 -> EnIn_PlayerLostRace

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: plays NA_SE_VO_IN_LOST after a short delay and, once the player talks, starts the second race; the counterpart of the already-named EnIn_PlayerWonSecondRace.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c
index d08618f27..963f8cb31 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c
@@ -31,7 +31,8 @@ void func_80A7B024(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);
 void EnIn_FinishClosingGate(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A7A770: auto-accepts the conversation, takes 50 rupees, sets the race state to 7 and moves to the rematch prompt.
 void EnIn_ChargeRaceFee(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A7A770 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80A7A940(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A7A940: plays NA_SE_VO_IN_LOST after a short delay and, once the player talks, starts the second race; the counterpart of the already-named EnIn_PlayerWonSecondRace.
+void EnIn_PlayerLostRace(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A7A940 [LLM:HIGH]
 // Name from zeldaret/oot (was func_80A7AA40): adopted upstream's name for this address; body verified to match upstream at 0.80. [oot: https://github.com/zeldaret/oot/blob/main/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c]
 void EnIn_PlayerWonSecondRace(EnIn* this, PlayState* play);
 // Name from zeldaret/oot (was func_80A7A4BC): adopted upstream's name for this address; body verified to match upstream at 1.00. [oot: https://github.com/zeldaret/oot/blob/main/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c]
@@ -611,7 +612,7 @@ void EnIn_WaitForObject(EnIn* this, PlayState* play) {
                     case 4:
                         EnIn_ChangeAnim(this, ENIN_ANIM_6);
                         this->unk_1EC = 8;
-                        this->actionFunc = func_80A7A940;
+                        this->actionFunc = EnIn_PlayerLostRace;  // was func_80A7A940 [LLM:HIGH]
                         break;
                     case 5:
                     case 6:
@@ -761,7 +762,7 @@ void EnIn_OfferRematch(EnIn* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80A7A940(EnIn* this, PlayState* play) {
+void EnIn_PlayerLostRace(EnIn* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->interactInfo.talkState == NPC_TALK_STATE_IDLE) {
         this->actor.flags |= ACTOR_FLAG_TALK_OFFER_AUTO_ACCEPTED;
         return;
